1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,100
Some Chinese towns have no roads — only water.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,600
These are the water towns of Jiangnan.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,100
A few have stood over 1,700 years.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,500
Stone bridges arch over every canal.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Ming and Qing houses line the water.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,400
Double-tap if you'd ride this boat.

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,000
Boatmen still pole wooden boats through the lanes.

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,600
Slow water towns beside a modern megacity.

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,600
* Expert Tip: reach Zhujiajiao before 9am to beat crowds.

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,000
Follow — one China place every day.
